ST('lifeofbrian', "A young Judean born in the stable next door to Jesus is mistaken for the Messiah and spends the rest of his life trying to get rid of his followers.", "He wasn't the Messiah. He was a very naughty boy.", "village/n//three wise men come to the wrong stable|field/d/A/the Sermon on the Mount; 'Blessed are the cheesemakers'|street/d/B/a Roman catches a vandal writing bad Latin|palace/d/C/Pontius Pilate's lisp|field/d/A/a crucifixion; 'Always Look on the Bright Side of Life'", "He's not the Messiah.|He's a very naughty boy.|Blessed are the cheesemakers.|Always look on the bright side of life.");
