ST('narayama', "In a 19th-century Japanese mountain village, an old woman prepares to be carried by her son to the mountain to die, as tradition demands.", "The ballad of Narayama.", "mountains/d//a village in the mountains|village/d//an old woman knocks out her own teeth|village/d//a family steals food|mountains/d//a son carries his mother up the mountain|mountains/d//snow falls on the mountain", "In the village, at seventy, you go to the mountain.|She's ready.|Her son isn't.|The snow is falling.");
