ST('withnail', "Two out-of-work actors in 1969 London escape their squalid flat for a holiday in the country at an uncle's cottage, and find the country even worse.", "We've gone on holiday by mistake.", "apartment/d/AB/a squalid Camden flat; something is alive in the kitchen sink|car/d/AB/they drive to the Lake District in a broken Jaguar|farm/n/AB/the cottage in the rain; no food, no wood|mansion/n//an uncle with designs on one of them arrives|field/d/A/he recites Hamlet to the wolves at the zoo in the rain", "Two actors.|No money.|A cottage in the rain.|We've gone on holiday by mistake.");
