ST('salaambombay', "Abandoned by a travelling circus, an eleven-year-old boy goes to Bombay to earn the five hundred rupees he owes his mother, and runs tea to the brothels and drug dens of the red-light district.", "Salaam Bombay!", "train/d//a boy left behind by a circus takes a train to the city|street/d//he carries tea glasses through Falkland Road to the brothels|apartment/n//a sixteen-year-old girl is sold to a brothel madam|street/n//a friend who smokes heroin dies on the street|street/n//the Ganesh festival; a boy alone on the steps, crying", "Eleven years old.|Five hundred rupees.|Tea for the brothels.|Bombay never lets go.");
