ST('storyqiuju', "When the village chief kicks her husband where it hurts in an argument over a shed, a pregnant peasant woman goes to the township, the county and then the city to get an apology.", "Not money. An apology.", "village/d/A/a pregnant woman with strings of chilli peppers drying on the wall|street/d/A/she wheels her husband into the township on a cart|snow/d/A/she sells chillies in the city in winter to pay for the lawsuit|village/n//the chief carries her to hospital through the snow when her labour goes wrong|village/d/A/she runs after the police car taking him away", "The chief kicked her husband.|She wants an apology.|She'll go all the way to the city.|She wins. Sort of.");
